Zero point energy                ...      0.24825728 Eh     155.78 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00924133 Eh       5.80 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
